  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Pour boiled water into a large saucepan and place over high heat with a pinch of salt.\n• Add penne to the boiling water and cook, over high heat, until ‘al dente’, 12 minutes.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/3 cup for 2 people / 2/3 cup for 4 people). Drain penne, then return to saucepan with a drizzle of olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834012ba756d38d6af30715/step-b34af000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook veggie mince and soffritto mix (no need for oil!), breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834012ba756d38d6af30715/step-beb16810.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium, then add tomato & herb seasoning and garlic paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in diced tomatoes with onion & garlic, the reserved pasta water and brown sugar and simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add cooked pasta and baby spinach leaves, stirring to combine, 1 minute. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834012ba756d38d6af30715/step-3a0cd420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide tomato and herb plant-based mince penne alla bolognese between bowls.\n• Top with Parmesan cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834012ba756d38d6af30715/step-7a414530.jpg"
    }
  ]
